      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know i could talk to someone but that just feels like another task on the list right? even therapy feels like just another way to try and fix the \"component\" so it can get back to work better. it's like the system just wants to patch the leak so the machine keeps running. there's no real escape from it. everything is just designed to keep the cycle going.",
